  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Slot</strong> None; <strong>Price</strong> 15,000 gp (lesser), 30,000 gp (normal), 60,000 gp (greater)<br>\n<strong>Weight</strong> 5 lbs.; <strong>Feat Cost</strong> 3 sp</p>\n<p>You allow a magic effect to function even without line of effect, transporting its effects through barriers that would otherwise impede it. You must still possess line of sight for effects that require it, and the target must still be within the effect’s range.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Apparatus, Burrowing Spell; <strong>Cost</strong> 7,500 gp (lesser), 15,000 gp (normal), 30,000 gp (greater)</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/apparatuses-metamagic#toc8\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": "<p>Selected profile: lesser tier; held slender rod. Use as part of casting a qualifying sphere effect while holding this apparatus in at least one hand. Spend one of its three daily uses; only one metamagic apparatus may apply per casting. The apparatus does not require knowing its feat or paying that feat’s extra spell points/casting time. Normal sphere-effect costs and other known metamagic costs still apply. The chosen sphere effect must be caster level 7 or lower.</p><p>Bypass line of effect through barriers only. Required line of sight and the talent’s normal range still apply.</p><p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/apparatuses-metamagic\">Shared metamagic apparatus rules</a>. The Feat Cost in the source applies to taking the feat instead of using the physical item.</p>",
      "unidentified": ""
    },
